# identitynow_managed_cluster

Manages a managed cluster, a group of virtual appliances or other clients that connect IdentityNow to on-premises sources. Clients are added with [identitynow_managed_client](managed_client).

Updates are sent as JSON Patch operations for the changed attributes only.

